            "row_content": "<p>Yes—you can send potential customers to this Blank Builder instead of a competitor’s builder, allowing them to design their glove directly with you. Orders must still be placed through your wholesale account. Once they finish designing their glove (Step 4 of 4 in the builder), they simply share their design link with you.</p>",
            "page": ""
