            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Absolutely. There are two ways to partner with My Glove Brand.</p><p><strong>Option 1: Builder on Site Route</strong><br/><br/>We implement your very own 3D custom glove builder directly on your website, fully branded with your logo on the palm, wrist and thumb.</p><p><strong>Option 2: Wholesale Route</strong></p><p>You won’t have a custom 3D builder on your site, but you’ll get access to our wholesale portal with a blank builder where you can manage designs and place orders.<br/><br/><a href=\"https://myglovebrand.com/\">https://myglovebrand.com/</a></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
